{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Nestory 可把照片庫變成私人生活地圖，將照片與文字筆記釘在事件發生的實際位置，適合想以地點重溫旅遊、居所與日常片段的人。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-24.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>地圖重溫每個回憶</h2>\n<p>Nestory 可將照片與筆記釘在地圖位置，加入日期、簡短筆記與多張照片，並在地圖或按年份時間軸瀏覽。用戶可按地點、筆記或時間搜尋，亦可批次匯入照片庫，由 App 自動辨識位置並分組；拉遠看全局，拉近聚焦單一瞬間。資料留在裝置，沒有伺服器、帳戶或社交功能，備份只經 iCloud 或 Google Drive，亦不會複製照片到額外儲存空間。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-21-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-22-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-23-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-24-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-25-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-26-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Nestory: Memory Map</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/nestory-memory-map/id6807875941?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.671016+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T23:19:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T22:18:52.383185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:40.464464+00:00","content_hash":"46a00629415d70658ad40f7abdb662136e8c8c93787effa911ea09be58ec115d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}